kunzite: Adreno 710 steps 4-5, the first GPU writes (kgpu=4/5; steps 1-3 unchanged, 0971).
4: CX GDSC on (gpu_cc_cx_gdsc 0x3d99108: SW_COLLAPSE off, PWR_ON in GDSCR or hw-ctrl 0x3d9953c),
only under software control and with GX off. 5: in kgsl's order, GCC GPLL0 div vote + ddrss_gpu_axi,
gmu_clk_src 200 MHz / hub_clk_src 150 MHz from GPLL0 div, then cxo/cx_gmu/hub_cx_int (must run)
and hlos1_vote_gpu_smmu. Each write is printed before it is made and recorded; after kgpu_hold s
(default 5) all of them are undone in reverse (CX collapse last). Facts: gpucc-parrot.c,
gcc-parrot.c, live FDT (GMU clock list, GDSC nodes), HackiOS redwood_adreno.c steps 4-5.

